def author(register,source,compact):
 register('b126','以孔位、鑽進訊號與水文證據建立可更新的掌子面前方模型~Build an updateable ahead-of-face model from borehole geometry, drilling signals and hydraulic evidence',['geo','geo3'],r'''
探測目標與盲區~Targets and blind zones||超前鑽孔是一條細長的取樣路徑，孔間未穿越的岩體仍可能藏有斷層。先把要回答的問題分成岩性界面、含水帶與空洞，再檢查孔軸是否真正截交目標；孔深不能代替橫向覆蓋。~A probe hole samples a slender path through the ground. A fault can remain between adjacent paths even when both holes are long. Separate the questions of lithological boundaries, water-bearing zones and voids, then check whether the planned trajectories actually intersect each target.||假設孔長30 m、偏角10°，橫向距離為30 sin10°=5.21 m；小角度定位誤差仍須另列。~For an assumed 30 m hole inclined by 10°, lateral reach is 30 sin10°=5.21 m; small angular positioning errors require separate allowance.||將孔口座標與實測方位投到同一里程剖面，標出各孔的覆蓋範圍及無資料區。以已知出露面或追加交叉孔驗證目標是否截交；地質師須逐項確認原先問題已回答，不能以完成鑽孔數量代替調查品質。~Plot surveyed collars and measured bearings on one chainage section, explicitly marking unsampled zones. Compare target intersections with mapped exposures or independent crossing holes. The geologist must confirm which original questions have been answered; completing the planned number of holes is not itself an acceptance criterion.||若將兩個無異常孔之間直接填成完整岩體，偏斜斷層可能被漏掉；開挖後突然出現破碎帶，原先支護與水處理預案便失去依據。~Interpolating intact rock between two uneventful holes can miss an oblique fault. Unexpected broken ground during excavation then undermines the original support and water-management assumptions.||鑽得越深就一定已排除整個掌子面前方風險。~Greater drilling depth always eliminates risk across the entire face ahead.||調查圖必須同時顯示孔跡與未取樣體積，將不能排除的地質假說交由主管地質工程師決定追加調查或保留控制措施。~Show both trajectories and unsampled volumes on the investigation drawing, and refer unresolved geological hypotheses to the responsible geotechnical engineer for additional evidence or retained controls.
孔跡與角度誤差~Trajectory and angular error||孔軸會因層面、鑽具剛度與鑽進偏心而彎曲，孔口方向只是起點。長孔把很小的角度偏差放大成可觀的平面位置差，因此地層交界里程必須附帶孔跡品質，不能只用鑽桿長度定位。~Boreholes curve under bedding effects, drill-string stiffness and eccentric drilling. Collar orientation describes only the starting direction. A small angular bias produces a substantial positional difference over a long hole, so an interpreted contact needs trajectory quality as well as rod length.||假設直孔100 m有1°方位偏差，末端側向差100 sin1°=1.745 m；這不是隨機誤差的標準差。~An assumed straight 100 m hole with a 1° bearing bias has a lateral offset of 100 sin1°=1.745 m; this is not a random-error standard deviation.||使用適合現場磁性環境的孔內測斜方法，與孔口獨立測量連接並保留測站間距。把正反向讀值和已知控制段比較，釐清系統偏差；地層位置的允收精度須由調查目的訂定，不能只引用儀器型錄精度。~Use a deviation survey suited to the magnetic environment and connect it to an independent collar survey. Retain station spacing and compare reverse readings with a known control interval. Specify acceptable contact-location uncertainty from the investigation purpose rather than the instrument brochure alone.||若鋼製設備使磁方位偏轉而未被識別，孔跡可能看似平順卻整體錯位；不同孔的同一地層因此被誤判為錯動或厚度變化。~Unrecognized magnetic interference from steel equipment can shift an apparently smooth trajectory. The same geological contact in different holes may then be mistaken for fault displacement or changing thickness.||孔口方向正確即可把所有孔內位置當成直線。~A correct collar direction makes every downhole position a straight-line projection.||交接孔跡時提供原始角度、坐標基準、修正方法及誤差範圍，讓設計者重建地層位置；大於目的精度的偏差由測量主管核准處置。~Deliver raw angles, coordinate datum, correction method and uncertainty so the designer can reconstruct contacts; the survey lead must resolve deviations exceeding the purpose-specific positional requirement.
鑽進比能辨識~Drilling specific energy||扭矩與轉速提供破岩功率，除以切削體積速率得到旋轉比能。比能上升可能來自硬岩，也可能是磨鈍鑽頭、孔壁摩擦或堵塞；只有在鑽具與操作條件可比時，才可把趨勢視為地質線索。~Torque and rotation give cutting power, which divided by excavated volume rate gives rotational specific energy. Rising energy may indicate harder rock, but also a worn bit, wall friction or blockage. Geological interpretation therefore requires comparable tooling and operating conditions.||假設T=200 N·m、每轉進尺0.02 m、孔徑0.1 m，E=2πT/(πD²p/4)=8.0 MJ/m³，僅含旋轉功。~Assume T=200 N·m, penetration p=0.02 m/revolution and D=0.1 m. E=2πT/(πD²p/4)=8.0 MJ/m³, accounting only for rotational work.||將扭矩、轉速、推力、進尺與換鑽頭時間同步繪圖，與岩屑及岩心描述比較。先剔除接桿與空轉段，再確認感測器量程及時間戳；若訊號變化只跟換具同時發生，不接受為地層界面的獨立證據。~Synchronize torque, speed, thrust, penetration and bit-change times with cuttings and core descriptions. Exclude rod changes and idle rotation, then check sensor range and timestamps. A change coincident only with tool replacement is not accepted as independent evidence of a geological contact.||磨耗後的能耗增加若全被解讀為高強度岩，可能低估軟弱夾層；硬度圖與取樣矛盾時應回查機械狀態，而非刪除不符合預期的岩心紀錄。~Treating wear-related energy increase as stronger rock may conceal a weak interbed. Disagreement with samples should trigger a tooling review, not deletion of inconvenient core observations.||比能越大就能直接換算出越高的岩石抗壓強度。~Higher specific energy directly determines a higher uniaxial rock strength.||以同一鑽頭生命週期建立比較基線，把維護事件列在地質日誌旁；未經場址校準的能量指標只可作為取樣優先順序。~Build comparison baselines within a single bit life and place maintenance events beside the geology log; an uncalibrated energy index may prioritize sampling but cannot replace strength testing.
岩屑輸送延遲~Cuttings transport lag||岩屑到達孔口時已落後鑽頭位置，且不同粒徑在回流中速度不同。若依回收時間直接指定地層深度，薄弱夾層會被向深處平移並混合；回流路徑、流量與沉積需要共同解釋。~Cuttings arrive at the collar after the bit has advanced, and different sizes travel at different speeds. Assigning depth from recovery time alone displaces and mixes thin layers. Return-path volume, flow and settling must be interpreted together.||假設回流容積0.15 m³、流量0.003 m³/s，平均延遲50 s；進尺0.01 m/s時深度偏移0.50 m。~With assumed return volume 0.15 m³ and flow 0.003 m³/s, mean delay is 50 s; advancement at 0.01 m/s shifts assigned depth by 0.50 m.||把流量計、鑽進記錄與取樣時鐘同步，利用可辨識岩性轉換核對延遲估算。記錄混樣範圍而非單一深度，並與相鄰岩心孔比對；當回流間斷或孔內沉積增加時，原先的定值延遲修正必須重新評估。~Synchronize flow metering, drilling records and sample clocks, checking estimated delay against identifiable lithological transitions. Record a mixing interval rather than a single depth and compare an adjacent core hole. Reassess a constant lag correction when returns become intermittent or downhole settling increases.||把延遲岩屑當作即時訊號會錯置含水或破碎帶，尤其薄層可能被多次混樣抹平；其結果是預警里程看似精確，實際已過了需要評估的區段。~Interpreting delayed cuttings as an immediate signal misplaces wet or fractured zones. Thin layers can be averaged away, producing a precise-looking warning chainage after the critical interval has passed.||岩屑從孔口流出時的鑽頭深度就是它的原始深度。~Bit depth when cuttings emerge is their original geological depth.||取樣標籤同時保留回收時間、估計來源深度區間和回流狀態；無法校正的混樣交由地質師判定用途，不作精確界面定位。~Sample labels must retain recovery time, estimated source interval and return condition; the geologist decides uses for unresolved mixed samples, which cannot locate a precise contact.
返水流量收支~Return-flow balance||進水與返水差額反映孔內儲存、裂隙吸水或外部湧入的合成效應，並不是裂隙滲透係數本身。鑽進速度與孔內容積變化會使短時間收支失衡，應先閉合水量帳再提出水文假說。~The difference between supply and return reflects changing storage, fracture losses and external inflow, not permeability alone. Advancement and changing hole volume disturb short-term balance. Close the water account before proposing a hydrogeological interpretation.||假設穩態供水20 L/min、返水27 L/min，淨流入7 L/min=0.117 L/s；未扣孔內儲存時不能稱穩態湧水量。~Assumed steady supply of 20 L/min and return of 27 L/min imply net inflow 7 L/min=0.117 L/s; without a storage correction it is not steady groundwater inflow.||以校準容積槽或流量計核對供回水兩側，註記接桿、停機及沖洗時段。比較同長時間窗的累積量並估計孔內儲存變化；水文工程師只有在穩態條件及漏失路徑獲得確認後，才接受該差額作為外來水證據。~Check both supply and return using calibrated tanks or meters and mark rod changes, stoppages and flushing. Compare cumulative quantities over matching windows and estimate storage changes. The hydrogeologist accepts the difference as external inflow evidence only after confirming steady conditions and accounting for losses.||流量感測器零點漂移可能製造假湧水，漏接返水則會掩蓋真流入；把未閉合水量直接外推成隧道總湧水量，會造成處理容量判斷失準。~Meter zero drift can create false inflow, while missed returns conceal real inflow. Extrapolating an unclosed water balance into tunnel-wide inflow gives a misleading treatment-capacity estimate.||返水比供水多就足以推算整座隧道的湧水量。~Excess return flow is sufficient to predict total tunnel groundwater inflow.||把水量平衡與地層里程分開保留原始檔，異常先查儀器與儲存再查地質；新增水文風險由主管工程師審查後調整預案。~Keep original water balances and geology chainage separately; investigate instruments and storage before attributing anomalies to geology, and obtain engineering review before changing the water-risk response.
水頭與壓力換算~Head and pressure conversion||量到的孔口壓力須配合高程基準才能形成水頭；壓力水頭與高程水頭不能任選其一。停流壓力也會受管路損失與等待時間影響，故量測系統和地下水系統必須分開建模。~Collar pressure requires a common elevation datum to become hydraulic head; pressure head and elevation head are complementary. Shut-in readings depend on line losses and equilibration time, so distinguish the measuring system from the groundwater system.||假設淡水ρ=1000 kg/m³、壓力490 kPa，壓力水頭p/(ρg)=49.95 m；總水頭另加測點高程。~For assumed fresh water with ρ=1000 kg/m³ and p=490 kPa, pressure head p/(ρg)=49.95 m; add sensor elevation to obtain total head.||使用有校準紀錄的壓力感測器並測定其高程，圖示觀測時間與壓力變化是否趨平。以第二量程或獨立水位觀測查核，將淡水密度及溫度假設列入誤差表；量到穩定數值仍需工程師確認測點與目標含水層的連通性。~Use a calibrated pressure sensor with surveyed elevation and plot stabilization over time. Check with a second range or independent water-level observation, documenting density and temperature assumptions. A stable number still requires engineering confirmation that the observation communicates with the intended water-bearing zone.||只比較不同高程的表壓可能把同一水頭誤判成壓力異常；殘留氣泡或管路堵塞又會拖慢響應，使停流後的短暫值被當成原位水壓。~Comparing gauge pressures at different elevations can falsely indicate anomalous groundwater. Air bubbles or blocked lines delay response and make a transient shut-in value appear to be in-situ pressure.||兩孔表壓相同就代表它們具有相同的地下水水頭。~Equal gauge pressures in two holes imply equal groundwater head.||所有壓力圖均標示感測器高程、壓力種類與等待時間；涉及帶壓孔口的工作只由核准專業程序執行，本課換算不是操作許可。~Every pressure plot must identify sensor elevation, pressure convention and waiting time; work at a pressurized collar requires an approved specialist procedure, not authorization from this calculation.
裂隙導水與尺度~Fracture flow and scale||單孔試驗只感受到與孔壁連通的裂隙網路，遠方未連通的高導水帶不一定被看見。等效滲透係數把複雜通道平均化，流速與邊界條件改變後，該平均值未必仍可直接移用。~A single-hole test senses fractures connected to its wall and may miss a distant conductive zone. Equivalent permeability averages a complex channel network. Changing velocity or boundaries can invalidate transfer of that average to a different scale.||假設Darcy條件k=10⁻⁶ m/s、面積2 m²、梯度5，Q=kAi=10⁻⁵ m³/s=0.01 L/s；裂隙慣性流不適用。~Assume Darcy conditions with k=10⁻⁶ m/s, area 2 m² and gradient 5. Q=kAi=10⁻⁵ m³/s=0.01 L/s; inertial fracture flow falls outside this model.||把試驗區間、壓差與流量同圖呈現，檢查升降階段是否可逆並與孔內影像的裂隙位置比較。量測結果應附模型、觀測尺度及邊界條件；若關係非線性或出現滯後，不以單一斜率當成可外推的材料常數。~Plot test interval, differential pressure and flow together, checking reversibility and comparing imaged fractures. Report model, scale and boundary conditions with the result. Nonlinearity or hysteresis prevents one fitted slope from being accepted as a transferable material constant.||若局部高導水裂隙被大量低透水岩體平均，整體係數看似小卻仍可能有集中出水；反之孔壁擾動也可能使局部試驗誇大天然連通性。~A low average coefficient can conceal concentrated flow through one conductive fracture. Conversely, disturbance at the borehole wall may exaggerate connectivity that is absent in the undisturbed rock mass.||單孔得到的滲透係數可無條件套用到整個隧道長度。~A permeability from one borehole applies unconditionally along the entire tunnel.||報告同時交付原始流量壓力曲線與可替代模型，要求水文工程師說明尺度轉換依據；不把本課的假設梯度當作試驗壓力。~Deliver raw pressure-flow curves with alternative interpretations and require a hydrogeologist to justify scale transfer; the assumed gradient in this exercise is not a test-pressure instruction.
多證據更新機率~Updating with multiple evidence||異常訊號可能是假陽性，無異常也可能是假陰性，解釋價值取決於先驗地質風險。震波與鑽孔若共享同一位置模型，兩者誤差可能相關，不能因資料來自兩種儀器就當成獨立證據。~Anomalies can be false positives and quiet records false negatives, so evidence depends on prior geological risk. Seismic and drilling interpretations may share a location model and correlated errors; different instruments do not automatically provide independent evidence.||假設危險帶先驗0.2、靈敏度0.8、假陽性0.1，陽性後機率=0.16/(0.16+0.08)=0.667。~Assume prior hazard probability 0.2, sensitivity 0.8 and false-positive rate 0.1. Probability after a positive is 0.16/(0.16+0.08)=0.667.||用事前凍結的判釋準則對照後續揭露的地質，分別記錄命中、漏判與假警報。審查樣本是否只收集已知異常區，並列出各證據共同依賴的資料；未有場址驗證前，機率數字只用於教學敏感度比較。~Compare a predeclared interpretation rule with subsequently exposed geology, counting hits, misses and false alarms separately. Check whether samples include only known anomalies and list shared dependencies. Before site validation, probability values serve teaching sensitivity analysis rather than calibrated operational prediction.||只統計成功預測而漏掉無異常區，會誇大探測可信度；再把相關證據連乘，可能形成過度自信的安全判斷，反而取消本應保留的調查。~Counting successful predictions without quiet areas inflates apparent reliability. Multiplying correlated evidence compounds overconfidence and can remove additional investigation that the unresolved ground conditions still require.||兩種儀器都沒有警報就代表風險機率必定為零。~No alarm from two instruments necessarily means zero hazard probability.||預先保存判讀時間與版本，以開挖揭露結果做盲對照；風險降低的結論須由負責地質與施工的工程師共同審查。~Preserve interpretation timestamps and versions for blind comparison with later exposure; any conclusion that risk has reduced requires joint review by the responsible geology and construction engineers.
取樣品質與回收~Sampling quality and recovery||岩心回收率衡量取回多少材料，並不直接等於原位完整程度。軟弱夾層更容易被沖失，留下的硬塊會造成選樣偏差；應把流失深度區間視為資訊缺口，而非自動補成堅硬岩石。~Core recovery measures material retrieved, not in-situ integrity. Weak layers preferentially wash out, leaving a biased sample of stronger pieces. Missing intervals are evidence gaps and must not be filled automatically with the properties of the remaining rock.||假設單回次長2.0 m、取回1.6 m，回收率=1.6/2.0=80%；遺失0.4 m仍需定位不確定性。~For an assumed 2.0 m run with 1.6 m recovered, recovery is 80%; the missing 0.4 m retains positional uncertainty.||將鑽進長度、岩心實長、破碎端面與沖洗紀錄一起核對，攝影保留比例尺和回次標記。以孔內影像或相鄰孔檢查缺失區是否對應弱層；回收率不足時，設計用強度樣本必須註明其對弱層的代表性限制。~Reconcile advance, recovered length, broken ends and flushing records, photographing scale and run markers. Compare imaging or adjacent holes to determine whether loss corresponds to a weak layer. Strength samples from incomplete recovery must disclose their limited representation of the missing material.||只測試取回的完整岩心會得到偏高強度分布，且缺失區若位置放錯，薄弱面可能被藏入別的回次；支護分類因而過度樂觀。~Testing only intact recovered pieces biases the strength distribution upward. Misplacing lost material can hide a weak plane in another run and produce an unjustifiably favorable support classification.||回收率高就能證明岩體沒有節理或軟弱夾層。~High core recovery proves that the rock mass has no joints or weak interbeds.||岩心箱與數位記錄使用同一孔號回次，缺失區不得以推測材料替補；代表性不足的試驗資料需地質師註記後才可交付設計。~Core boxes and digital logs must share hole and run identifiers; never replace lost intervals with inferred material, and require the geologist to flag unrepresentative tests before design handover.
調查到開挖交接~Investigation-to-excavation handover||調查價值在於改變可追溯的工程判斷，而非累積孔數。把預測界面、信心範圍與後續揭露逐段對照，可辨別地質模型是否隨開挖失效；觀測條件變化時，應保留舊版本以解釋當時決策。~Investigation matters when it changes a traceable engineering decision. Comparing predicted contacts, uncertainty intervals and later exposure reveals when a ground model stops being adequate. Retain previous versions so changing observations do not erase the evidence available at each decision.||假設10項待回答地質問題中有8項獲獨立證據，證據完成率80%；其餘2項不能按平均分數判成通過。~If independent evidence addresses 8 of 10 assumed geological questions, evidence completion is 80%; the remaining 2 cannot be accepted through an average score.||逐項核對問題清單、孔號、原始觀測與設計影響，抽一筆資料從圖面追溯到感測器或岩心箱。以後續掌子面記錄驗證預測，將未解決項列成責任與期限；主管工程師依具體風險而非整體完成率核准進入下一審查節點。~Audit each question against hole identifiers, raw observations and design consequences, tracing a sample drawing back to sensor records or the core box. Check predictions against later face logs and assign owners and deadlines to unresolved items. Approval depends on the specific remaining risk, not overall completion percentage.||缺少孔號或版本會使正確量測也無法對應到開挖位置；若未解決風險被埋在完成率內，施工團隊可能誤以為調查已排除所有不利情況。~Missing identifiers or versions make even accurate measurements unusable at the excavation location. Burying unresolved risks inside a completion percentage can imply that all adverse conditions have been excluded.||調查報告交付百分之百就等於所有地質風險已消失。~Delivering the entire investigation report means all geological risk has disappeared.||交接表分列已證實、推論及未解決項目，附適用里程與失效條件；地質、設計及施工負責人共同確認控制措施的更新責任。~The handover separates observations, interpretations and unresolved items with chainage and invalidation conditions; geology, design and construction leads jointly confirm responsibility for updating the controls.
''')
 compact('b127','分辨震波反射、速度模型與定位不確定性，將預測交由鑽孔驗證~Distinguish seismic reflections, velocity models and location uncertainty before borehole validation',['amberg-seismic','geo'],r'''
阻抗反差與反射~Impedance contrast and reflection||反射源是密度與波速形成的阻抗差，並非岩性名稱本身。含水、裂隙和風化皆能改變波速，故同一振幅異常可以有不同地質成因，應保留極性與入射幾何。~Reflection arises from acoustic impedance contrast, not a rock name. Water, fractures and weathering can alter velocity, so an amplitude anomaly admits several geological explanations and must retain polarity and incidence geometry.||假設兩側阻抗15與9 MRayl，正入射R=(9−15)/(9+15)=−0.25；負號表示反相，非負能量。~For assumed impedances of 15 and 9 MRayl, normal-incidence R=(9−15)/(9+15)=−0.25; the sign indicates phase reversal, not negative energy.||比對已知界面的波形極性、感測器方向及密度波速資料，並用探孔確認異常帶；振幅須先扣除幾何擴散與儀器增益，不能直接當成破碎程度。~Compare polarity at a known interface, receiver orientation and density-velocity information, then verify anomalies with probing; remove geometric spreading and instrument gain before interpreting amplitude as damage.||若把反相一律當成含水斷層，低密度乾燥帶也會觸發誤判；若增益設定遺失，前後測次的振幅比較將無法支持地質變化結論。~Calling every polarity reversal a water-bearing fault misclassifies dry low-density zones. Missing gain settings also invalidate amplitude comparisons between surveys and any inferred geological change.
走時與距離反演~Travel time and distance||回波走時包含去程和回程，距離估算先依賴速度模型，再依賴反射方向。掌子面附近的低速擾動區可能加長走時，若全路徑仍採完整岩速度，異常距離會被高估。~Echo time includes outward and return travel. Distance therefore depends on velocity and reflector direction. A damaged low-velocity zone near the face lengthens travel time, potentially overestimating distance when intact-rock velocity is used throughout.||假設正向反射v=4000 m/s、雙程t=0.040 s，d=vt/2=80 m；速度提高10%時距離為88 m。~Assume a frontal reflection with v=4000 m/s and two-way t=0.040 s. d=vt/2=80 m; increasing velocity by 10% gives 88 m.||先用已知源收距離的直達波估速，將不同速度假說的反射位置畫成區間；再對照探孔截交里程，確認不是斜側方界面被投影到正前方。~Estimate velocity from direct arrivals at surveyed offsets and plot reflector positions for alternative velocity hypotheses; compare probe intersections to exclude an oblique side reflector projected directly ahead.||錯把雙程走時當成單程會把距離放大兩倍；另一常見症狀是反射位置隨速度設定大量移動，卻在報告中仍只標出一條精確界線。~Treating two-way time as one-way doubles distance. Another warning is a reflector moving substantially with velocity assumptions while the report still draws a single apparently precise boundary.
頻率與分辨能力~Frequency and resolution||高頻提供較短波長，能分開更靠近的界面，但在破碎岩中也更快衰減。可探測距離與分辨率因此互相制約，取樣間距很密並不能補回地層已濾掉的高頻資訊。~Higher frequency shortens wavelength and separates closer interfaces, but attenuates more strongly in fractured ground. Reach and resolution trade off, and dense sampling cannot restore high-frequency information already filtered by the rock mass.||假設v=4000 m/s、f=1000 Hz，波長λ=4 m，四分之一波長尺度約1 m；它是簡化分辨尺度非保證。~With assumed v=4000 m/s and f=1000 Hz, wavelength λ=4 m and a quarter-wavelength scale is about 1 m; this simplified scale is not a guarantee.||檢視原始與處理後頻譜，分列可用頻帶和處理濾波器；以已知厚度的模型或合成波形檢查雙界面可辨性，避免把色階像素大小誤當地質分辨率。~Inspect raw and processed spectra and document bandwidth and filters; test separation of two interfaces with a known model or synthetic waveform rather than equating display pixel size with geological resolution.||過度平滑會把兩條薄弱面合成一條厚帶，過度銳化則可能製造假界面；僅靠漂亮成像判定薄層厚度，會給支護設計虛假的精度。~Smoothing can merge two weak planes into one thick zone, while sharpening may manufacture interfaces. Estimating layer thickness from image appearance alone gives support design unjustified precision.
取樣與時間混疊~Sampling and time aliasing||數位取樣須能追蹤欲保留的最高頻率，否則高頻會折回成假低頻。抗混疊濾波作用在取樣之前，事後再增加顯示點數只能插值，不能恢復已混疊的原始資訊。~Sampling must resolve the highest retained frequency or high-frequency energy folds into a false lower frequency. Anti-alias filtering acts before sampling; adding display points afterward only interpolates and cannot recover aliased information.||假設取樣頻率8000 Hz，Nyquist頻率4000 Hz，時間間隔0.125 ms；保留頻帶仍須低於理想上界。~At assumed sampling frequency 8000 Hz, the Nyquist frequency is 4000 Hz and interval 0.125 ms; the retained band must remain below the ideal boundary.||核對記錄器原始取樣率、前置濾波與時鐘設定，用已知頻率訊號查核頻譜；處理者需保留未重取樣檔，並證明走時拾取在合理頻帶變更下仍穩定。~Check native sample rate, front-end filters and clocks using a known-frequency signal; retain files before resampling and demonstrate that picked arrivals remain stable under reasonable changes of processing bandwidth.||取樣不足造成的假頻率可能被誤判成岩體衰減，重取樣後曲線雖平順卻仍錯；若原始檔被覆寫，就無法判斷異常是地質還是記錄器產生。~Aliasing can masquerade as geological attenuation; resampling smooths the curve but does not correct it. Overwritten raw files prevent distinguishing ground behavior from an acquisition artifact.
疊加與相關雜訊~Stacking and correlated noise||重複訊號相干相加，獨立零均值雜訊的標準差只按平方根增加，故疊加可改善訊雜比。持續機械振動若與測次同步，卻也會相干累積，不能用測次數保證品質。~Repeated signals add coherently while independent zero-mean noise grows only with the square root of count. Synchronous mechanical vibration also adds coherently, so record count alone cannot guarantee improved quality.||假設16筆獨立等品質訊號疊加，振幅訊雜比提高√16=4倍，20log10(4)=12.04 dB。~Stacking an assumed 16 independent equal-quality records improves amplitude signal-to-noise ratio by √16=4, or 20log10(4)=12.04 dB.||比較不同子集合的疊加結果及背景振動時段，量測噪音是否隨平方根縮減；若異常只在特定機具運轉時存在，需以獨立時段或替代量測驗證。~Compare stacks from different subsets and background-vibration periods, testing whether noise follows square-root reduction; an anomaly tied to one operating machine requires an independent time window or alternative measurement.||把相干機械雜訊誤當隨機雜訊會在疊加後產生更清晰的假反射，品質指標反而變好；若只選漂亮測次，報告會掩蓋訊號的不穩定性。~Coherent machine noise can become a clearer false reflector after stacking while superficial quality indicators improve. Selecting only attractive records conceals instability and biases the final interpretation.
測線幾何與偏移~Survey geometry and migration||源收座標決定射線路徑與反射點，側壁布置的量測不一定正對前方。偏移成像把走時轉成空間位置時必須使用正確孔位和速度，否則側向地質可能被移到開挖軸線。~Source and receiver coordinates govern ray paths and reflection points. Sidewall arrays do not necessarily look straight ahead. Migration needs correct geometry and velocity or lateral features may be moved onto the excavation axis.||假設反射距離80 m、方位不確定5°，橫向位置尺度80sin5°=6.97 m；不能只報里程誤差。~For assumed reflector range 80 m and azimuth uncertainty 5°, lateral position scale is 80sin5°=6.97 m; chainage error alone is insufficient.||用測量控制點核對源收三維位置，分別處理正前方與斜向的合成反射測試；將定位橢球與隧道斷面重疊，只有與開挖影響區相交的解釋才進入風險審查。~Survey three-dimensional source-receiver positions and test both frontal and oblique synthetic reflectors; overlay positional uncertainty on the tunnel section and review interpretations that intersect the excavation influence zone.||使用舊掌子面里程或錯誤側壁座標會使成像整體偏移；施工團隊可能提前或延後處理異常區，並錯把後來揭露的不一致歸因於地質不可預測。~Old face chainage or incorrect sidewall coordinates shift the entire image. Responses may occur too early or late, with the discrepancy wrongly blamed on inherently unpredictable geology.
波速與彈性假設~Velocity and elastic assumptions||動態波速對應小應變快速載入，不能直接當成長時間靜態變形模數。裂隙閉合、飽和與各向異性使兩者差異更大，任何由波速推算的模數都必須保留密度和均質等向假設。~Dynamic velocities describe small-strain rapid loading rather than long-term static stiffness. Crack closure, saturation and anisotropy increase the distinction. Moduli inferred from waves must retain density and homogeneous isotropic assumptions.||假設ρ=2500 kg/m³、Vs=2000 m/s，Gdyn=ρVs²=10 GPa；Vs增加10%使Gdyn增加21%。~For assumed ρ=2500 kg/m³ and Vs=2000 m/s, Gdyn=ρVs²=10 GPa; a 10% rise in Vs raises Gdyn by 21%.||比較不同方向的P與S波速度並附密度來源，再與相同岩性靜態試驗分開繪圖；若要用於變形計算，必須有場址校準與應變尺度說明，而非以一個固定折減係數自動接受。~Compare directional P- and S-wave velocities with documented density, plotting static tests separately; deformation use requires site calibration and strain-scale justification rather than automatic acceptance through one reduction factor.||把高頻動態模數直接放入長期收斂模型通常會低估變形，裂隙岩尤為明顯；模數看似精確卻缺少應變範圍，模型結果便不可追溯。~Direct use of high-frequency dynamic modulus in a long-term convergence model can underpredict movement, especially in jointed rock. A precise modulus without strain-scale context makes the result untraceable.
衰減與振幅混淆~Attenuation and amplitude ambiguity||振幅沿路徑受材料吸收、散射和幾何擴散共同減弱。接收器耦合不良也會降低振幅，因此衰減參數的反演需要校準源強與接收增益，不能只比較遠近兩個峰值。~Amplitude decays through absorption, scattering and geometric spreading. Poor receiver coupling also reduces amplitude, so attenuation inversion requires source and receiver calibration rather than a comparison of two peaks alone.||假設純指數衰減A/A0=e^(−αx)，α=0.01 m⁻¹、x=50 m，比例e⁻⁰·⁵=0.607；未計擴散。~Assume purely exponential decay A/A0=e^(−αx), α=0.01 m⁻¹ and x=50 m. The ratio is e⁻⁰·⁵=0.607, excluding geometric spreading.||檢查同一接收器的重複耦合測次並使用參考源強，分頻段比較衰減模型；將無法分離的吸收與散射列為聯合效應，只有附校準紀錄的振幅才參與地質對比。~Repeat coupling checks for the same receiver with a reference source, comparing attenuation by frequency band; report inseparable absorption and scattering jointly and use only calibrated amplitudes in geological comparisons.||鬆動感測器可讓完好岩體看似強衰減帶，若再由此推測地下水會放大誤判；反之自動增益補償也可能掩蓋真實的遠距訊號衰減。~A loose receiver can make intact rock resemble a strongly attenuating zone and encourage false groundwater inference; automatic gain correction can conversely conceal genuine attenuation at distance.
走時誤差傳播~Travel-time uncertainty propagation||速度與走時各有不確定性，定位可信度由兩者共同控制。若速度來自同一批到時資料，誤差可能相關；平方和公式只適用獨立小誤差，不能把未知系統偏差包裝成高精度標準差。~Velocity and time jointly control location uncertainty. If velocity is estimated from the same arrivals, errors may correlate. Root-sum-square propagation applies only to small independent errors, not unidentified systematic bias.||假設d=80 m、速度標準不確定5%、走時2%，獨立時ud=80√(0.05²+0.02²)=4.31 m。~Assume d=80 m with independent relative standard uncertainties of 5% in velocity and 2% in time; ud=80√(0.05²+0.02²)=4.31 m.||由不同判讀者盲選到時，對照速度模型敏感度及儀器時間校準；報告分列隨機、系統與模型誤差，並用已知界面檢驗實際覆蓋率，而不把一個標準差當成確定界線。~Have independent interpreters pick arrivals blindly and compare velocity sensitivity with clock calibration; separate random, systematic and model errors and test coverage at known interfaces rather than treating one standard deviation as a definite boundary.||忽略速度不確定性會使時間拾取再精準也無法改善真實定位；以窄信賴帶掩蓋錯誤速度模型，可能讓探孔錯過原本應驗證的異常位置。~Ignoring velocity uncertainty prevents precise timing from improving actual location. A narrow confidence band around the wrong velocity model can direct verification holes away from the true anomaly.
預測與揭露對照~Prediction and exposure comparison||預測須在開挖揭露前固定版本，否則事後調整解釋會掩蓋漏判。判斷品質同時看成功預警與無異常區的錯警報，並把不可見範圍列出，不能讓彩色影像代替可核對的假說。~Freeze predictions before excavation exposes the ground, or retrospective interpretation hides misses. Assess both successful warnings and false alarms in quiet zones and state blind areas; a colored image is not a testable hypothesis.||假設已知10個異常中預測8個，靈敏度80%；另有20個正常區錯報3個，假陽性率15%，兩指標分列。~If 8 of an assumed 10 anomalies are predicted, sensitivity is 80%; 3 false alarms among 20 normal intervals give 15% false-positive rate, reported separately.||用原始預測里程區間對照後續面誌與鑽孔，設定同一命中距離規則並保留未判定區；地質主管審查誤判原因是否來自覆蓋、處理或地質模型，才更新下一輪調查計畫。~Compare original prediction intervals with later face logs and boreholes using one predefined matching rule and retaining unclassified zones; the geology lead separates coverage, processing and model errors before updating investigation.||僅展示成功案例會使預測能力看似完美，漏判和假警報都被消失；依這種偏差資料減少探孔，反而使未被震波捕捉的風險缺乏最後驗證。~Presenting only successful examples makes prediction appear flawless by removing misses and false alarms. Reducing probing on that biased evidence leaves seismically undetected hazards without independent verification.
''')
 compact('b128','從回次、節理與試驗代表性推導岩體分類的適用邊界~Derive rock-mass classification boundaries from runs, discontinuities and test representativeness',['geo3','isrm-methods'],r'''
回次與深度閉合~Runs and depth closure||岩心箱的順序建立地下空間的索引，鑽進回次與回收長度不閉合時，後續試驗再精準也會失去位置。接桿量測、殘留岩心與鑽具長度須分開記錄，不能把深度誤差藏入某個破碎段。~Core-box order indexes subsurface space. If advance and recovery do not close, even precise tests lose their location. Record rod measurements, retained core and tooling lengths separately instead of hiding a depth discrepancy inside a broken interval.||假設鑽進3.0 m、岩心2.7 m，TCR=90%，缺失0.3 m；缺失所在深度仍不唯一。~For assumed advance 3.0 m and recovered core 2.7 m, TCR=90% and loss=0.3 m; the location of that loss remains nonunique.||核對鑽班原始進尺、岩心箱分隔牌與完整照片，重新量測岩心長度；深度無法閉合的回次需標出不確定區間，待記錄者與地質師共同釐清，不能默默移動標牌。~Reconcile original drilling advance, run dividers and complete photographs and remeasure recovered length; mark unresolved intervals for joint review by the logger and geologist rather than silently moving a divider.||把孔底殘留岩心歸入下一回次會重複或錯置地層，缺失區則可能被假想成完整材料；其後的強度曲線雖連續，卻不對應真實深度。~Assigning retained bottom core to the next run duplicates or shifts geology and can fill losses with imaginary intact material. A smooth subsequent strength profile then represents the wrong depths.
岩石品質指標~Rock quality designation||RQD只計符合長度條件的健全岩心，機械折斷應辨識並重接；它反映沿孔方向的塊體分割，而不是完整三維岩體強度。與孔平行的節理很少被截交，方向偏差必須保留。~RQD counts sound pieces meeting a length criterion, with recognized mechanical breaks reassembled. It describes segmentation along the hole rather than three-dimensional mass strength. Joints parallel to the hole are undersampled, so directional bias remains.||假設2 m回次內長度至少100 mm的健全岩心合計1.4 m，RQD=1.4/2×100=70%。~If sound pieces at least 100 mm long total an assumed 1.4 m within a 2 m run, RQD=1.4/2×100=70%.||用端面吻合與新鮮破面區分機械斷裂，逐段保留計入長度及照片；另一位記錄者獨立複核臨界長度岩心，再對照孔方向與節理組，確認分類未忽略取樣方向。~Distinguish mechanical breaks using matching fresh ends and retain counted lengths and photographs; a second logger checks borderline pieces, then compares hole orientation with joint sets to expose directional sampling bias.||把鑽具造成的折斷當成自然節理會低估RQD；只看高RQD又可能漏掉一條控制大楔體的持續節理，支護需求並不隨單一百分比單調決定。~Counting drilling breaks as natural joints underestimates RQD. Conversely, high RQD can coexist with one persistent plane controlling a large wedge, so support demand is not determined by that percentage alone.
節理間距方向~Directional joint spacing||掃描線截交頻率取決於節理法線和測線夾角；同一岩體由不同方向鑽孔會得到不同表觀間距。幾何修正接近平行時變得不穩定，應報告不可辨識的組別而非無限放大權重。~Intersection frequency depends on the angle between joint normal and survey line. Different hole directions produce different apparent spacing. Corrections become unstable near parallel orientation, requiring an unresolved-set warning rather than unbounded weighting.||假設真法向間距0.3 m、測線與法線60°，表觀間距0.3/cos60°=0.6 m。~Assume normal spacing 0.3 m and a 60° angle between line and normal; apparent spacing is 0.3/cos60°=0.6 m.||將孔軸與節理極點畫在同一球面投影，查核取向資料的定向基準；以不同方向孔或露頭掃描線交叉驗證，接近平行且樣本稀少的組別須在報告中明示下限或缺口。~Plot hole axes and joint poles on the same stereonet and verify orientation datum; cross-check differently directed holes or exposure scanlines and state bounds or gaps for nearly parallel, sparsely sampled sets.||忽略方向會把一組密集但與孔平行的節理判成稀疏，造成塊體尺寸高估；粗暴修正少數截交又會讓單一節理主導整體統計。~Ignoring orientation makes a closely spaced, hole-parallel joint set appear sparse and overestimates block size. Aggressive correction of a few intersections can instead let one observation dominate the statistics.
節理表面與充填~Joint surfaces and infill||節理粗糙度、風化與充填共同決定剪力機制，兩個表面是否接觸比單看顏色重要。厚軟填土可隔開岩壁粗糙峰，於是完整岩石強度再高也不能代表節理面的抗剪能力。~Roughness, weathering and infill jointly govern joint shear. Contact between opposing walls matters more than color. Thick weak infill can separate rough rock asperities, making intact rock strength irrelevant to the shearing plane.||假設填料厚4 mm、有效粗糙峰高2 mm，厚度比4/2=2；此幾何比不等於可直接使用的強度折減係數。~For assumed infill thickness 4 mm and effective asperity height 2 mm, the ratio is 2; this geometric ratio is not a directly usable strength-reduction factor.||以比例照片、觸感及樣品描述保存填料厚度和連續性，避免清洗後才記錄；同時比較飽和狀態及相同法向應力的剪力試驗，只有一致的材料與邊界條件才可互相比對。~Preserve scaled photographs and samples of infill thickness and continuity before washing; compare saturation and shear tests at matching normal stress, accepting comparisons only for consistent material and boundary conditions.||洗去黏土後記錄的粗糙岩壁會誇大現地摩擦力，乾燥樣品也可能掩蓋遇水軟化；看似良好節理在開挖卸荷與滲水後仍可能滑動。~Washing clay away exaggerates the friction represented by rough walls, while dry samples conceal water softening. An apparently favorable joint can still slide after excavation unloading and seepage.
單軸強度與取樣~Uniaxial strength and sampling||單軸壓縮是完整岩石試件的強度，不包含大尺度節理。端面平整、長徑比與含水狀態影響破壞模式，若只挑完整段製樣，得到的分布會系統性排除最差地層。~Uniaxial compression measures intact specimen strength, excluding large joints. End preparation, slenderness and moisture influence failure. Selecting only pieces convenient for preparation systematically removes the weakest ground from the resulting distribution.||假設直徑50 mm試體破壞荷重200 kN，σ=P/(πD²/4)=101.9 MPa；不等於岩體強度。~An assumed 50 mm diameter specimen failing at 200 kN gives σ=P/(πD²/4)=101.9 MPa; this is not rock-mass strength.||量測直徑與端面條件，拍攝破壞型態並追溯樣品孔號深度；把無法製樣的軟弱段另列，採相應試驗補足代表性，試驗主管依適用方法確認數據能否比較。~Measure diameter and end condition, photograph failure and trace hole-depth identity; list weak intervals that could not be prepared and investigate them appropriately, with the laboratory lead confirming method-compatible comparisons.||端部摩擦可能使試件呈異常錐形破壞，缺陷樣本剔除過多又會抬高平均強度；將這種平均值直接給整體岩體，會掩蓋支配變形的弱面。~End friction can produce abnormal conical failure, while rejecting too many flawed samples raises mean strength. Applying that mean to the mass hides weak surfaces controlling deformation.
分類分項透明~Transparent classification components||分類系統把多種觀測壓縮成工程指標，總分相同並不意味相同失效機制。強度佳但節理不利與強度弱但塊狀完整可能得到相似分數，設計必須保留各分項及地下水情境。~Classification compresses observations into an index, but equal totals need not mean equal mechanisms. Strong rock with adverse joints can resemble weak but massive rock numerically, so component ratings and groundwater scenarios must remain visible.||假設六個示範評分為12、15、10、20、7、−5，合計59；此加總練習不聲稱對應某版分類門檻。~Assumed illustrative component scores of 12,15,10,20,7 and −5 total 59; this arithmetic exercise does not claim a threshold in a particular classification edition.||保存每一分項的原始依據、評分表版本及評分者，對地下水或取向做敏感度比較；以實際出露和變形驗證推薦支護的適用性，總分僅作索引而非自動施工指令。~Retain evidence, rating-table edition and assessor for every component and test water and orientation sensitivity; verify support applicability against exposures and movement, using the total as an index rather than an automatic construction instruction.||把缺少資料的分項設成最有利分數，會產生看似完整的分類；兩種機制不同的岩體因總分相同被配上同一支護，可能漏掉楔體或擠壓問題。~Assigning favorable values to missing components creates false completeness. Equal totals can then assign identical support to different mechanisms, overlooking wedge instability or squeezing ground.
乘法指標敏感~Multiplicative index sensitivity||乘法形式的岩體指標對分母與低值項特別敏感，輸入稍有改動即可跨越多個等級。這種指標是經驗模型，必須使用同一版本定義，不能把不同方法中同名因子混在一起。~Multiplicative rock indices are sensitive to denominators and small factors, so modest input changes may cross several classes. These empirical models require consistent edition-specific definitions; similarly named factors from different systems are not interchangeable.||假設Q=(60/9)(2/3)(1/5)=0.889；若Jw由1降為0.5，其餘不變，Q=0.444。~For assumed Q=(60/9)(2/3)(1/5)=0.889, reducing Jw from 1 to 0.5 while holding other factors fixed gives Q=0.444.||由原始節理組數、粗糙狀況、水情與應力描述追查各比值，另以合理上下限重算；若輸入只是假設，結果不得轉成精確支護間距，需由岩工工程師結合失效分析審查。~Trace each ratio to joint-set count, surface condition, water and stress descriptions and recalculate plausible bounds; assumed inputs must not become precise support spacing without rock-engineering review of failure mechanisms.||把地下水因子視為永久不變會忽略季節或開挖導水，錯誤分母又可使指標偏差數倍；輸出小數位再多也不能補足取樣與判讀不足。~Treating water factors as permanent ignores seasonal or excavation-induced changes; an incorrect denominator shifts the index severalfold, and extra decimal places do not cure deficient sampling or interpretation.
尺度與代表體積~Scale and representative volume||小岩心可能完全避開長而連續的節理，卻又把局部碎裂段過度放大。從厘米試件到隧道尺度需要描述結構面的持續性、間距與連通，不能只把試體尺寸比例套在強度上。~Small cores may miss persistent joints while overemphasizing one crushed interval. Moving from centimetre specimens to tunnel scale requires persistence, spacing and connectivity, not a strength correction based solely on specimen dimensions.||假設隧道直徑10 m、岩心直徑0.05 m，尺度比200；截面面積比200²=40000，不能據此直接縮減強度。~For assumed tunnel diameter 10 m and core diameter 0.05 m, length ratio is 200 and area ratio 40000; neither directly determines a strength reduction.||將岩心、露頭與掌子面節理圖放在共同坐標中，查核長節理是否延續及樣本是否覆蓋主要岩性；統計不收斂時須增補資料或給區間，不能以增加同一小區域樣本假裝提高全場代表性。~Integrate core, exposure and face-joint maps in one coordinate system, checking persistence and lithological coverage; nonconvergent statistics require added evidence or intervals, not merely more samples from the same small area.||過度依賴完整小樣會低估大塊體滑落，單一破碎回次又可能使整段支護過度保守；兩種偏差都來自把局部觀測誤當代表體積。~Reliance on intact small samples underestimates large-block movement, whereas one crushed run may overstate support demand along a long reach; both mistakes confuse local evidence with a representative volume.
記錄者差異控制~Controlling logger differences||岩心描述含觀察與判斷，顏色、風化與節理條件的用語須有共同基準。雙人記錄不是取平均即可，分歧若集中於某一因子，應先找照明、樣品狀態或定義差異。~Core logging combines observation and judgment. Color, weathering and joint condition need common definitions. Independent logs should not simply be averaged; concentrated disagreement points to lighting, sample state or inconsistent definitions requiring review.||假設20段中兩位記錄者有16段分類一致，原始一致率80%；它未扣除偶然一致，不能等同Kappa。~If two loggers agree on 16 of an assumed 20 intervals, raw agreement is 80%; without chance correction this is not a kappa statistic.||以盲重記固定比例岩心，交叉比較分項而非只比總分；用保留的照片和樣品討論分歧並記錄裁定依據，若方法改版則保留舊版，避免悄悄改寫原始觀察。~Blindly relog a fixed sample and compare components rather than totals; resolve discrepancies using retained images and specimens and document the basis, preserving earlier versions when methods change instead of rewriting original observations.||不同班次使用不同風化尺度會造成假的地質突變，總分平均反而藏住問題；後續設計無法知道變化來自地層還是記錄習慣。~Different weathering scales across shifts create artificial geological changes, and averaged totals hide the problem. Designers then cannot distinguish changing ground from changing logging practice.
分類到模型交接~Classification-to-model handover||岩體分類提供經驗參考，數值模型還需要應力、構造與水文邊界。交接應列明哪些參數來自試驗、哪些來自關聯式，並說明不利節理是否顯式建模，避免同一弱化作用被重複計入。~Classification supplies empirical context while analysis also requires stress, structure and hydraulic boundaries. Handover distinguishes tested and correlated parameters and explicit joints, preventing the same weakening effect from being counted twice.||假設10個設計參數中6個實測、4個推估，推估比例40%；這是證據組成而非模型失敗機率。~If 6 of an assumed 10 design parameters are measured and 4 inferred, the inferred fraction is 40%; this describes evidence composition, not model failure probability.||從設計參數表抽查至岩心箱、試驗單與分類公式，檢查單位、版本和尺度；針對推估參數安排敏感度包絡，只有主管工程師確認主控失效機制與資料相符後才釋出分析結論。~Trace model parameters to core boxes, test sheets and classification equations, checking units, edition and scale; bracket inferred values in sensitivity analysis and release conclusions only after engineering review of governing failure mechanisms.||若同時折減整體模數又以低剛度節理表達同一裂隙，可能重複弱化；反過來省略節理而仍用完整岩模數，會得到不合理的小變形。~Reducing bulk stiffness and adding soft joints for the same fractures can double-count weakening; omitting joints while retaining intact-rock stiffness produces unrealistically small movements in the opposite direction.
''')
 compact('b129','以孔壁成像幾何、方位校準及水力交叉證據辨識裂隙~Interpret fractures through borehole-image geometry, orientation calibration and hydraulic cross-checks',['usgs-imaging','geo'],r'''
光學與聲學互補~Optical and acoustic complementarity||光學影像顯示顏色和材料關係，聲學影像反映孔壁反射與幾何，兩者對混濁水及孔壁覆膜的反應不同。互補資料可區分影像消失與真正的構造中斷，不能把看不清的區段當成無裂隙。~Optical images show color and material relationships, while acoustic images respond to wall reflection and geometry. Turbid water and coatings affect them differently, so combined evidence separates lost visibility from a real structural termination.||假設100 m孔中光學可讀70 m、聲學可讀90 m，重疊可讀65 m，至少一種可讀為70+90−65=95 m。~For an assumed 100 m hole, readable optical length 70 m, acoustic length 90 m and overlap 65 m give 95 m readable by at least one method.||逐段建立可讀性遮罩，對照水清濁、反射振幅與孔徑，將兩種影像同深度並排；無法判讀的5 m仍需其他資料補足，不能把不同物理對比強行當成同一顏色尺度。~Create interval-by-interval readability masks and align images with turbidity, amplitude and diameter; the unreadable 5 m still needs other evidence, and different physical contrasts must not be forced onto one color scale.||自動增亮可能把噪點變成假裂隙，聲學低振幅也可能只是粗糙孔壁；若未保存可讀性限制，裂隙統計會把資料缺失誤當優良岩體。~Automatic enhancement may turn noise into apparent cracks, and low acoustic amplitude can reflect rough walls. Missing readability limits make fracture statistics confuse absent data with sound rock.
展開影像與傾角~Unwrapped images and dip||平面裂隙切穿圓孔時在展開圖上形成正弦曲線；波幅與孔徑共同決定相對孔軸的傾角。只有孔軸近鉛直且坐標已校正時，簡單幾何傾角才可直接視為地質傾角。~A planar fracture intersecting a circular hole becomes a sinusoid when unwrapped. Its amplitude and hole diameter determine dip relative to the axis. This simple dip represents geological dip directly only for a properly oriented near-vertical hole.||假設鉛直孔直徑0.10 m、正弦半振幅0.05 m，tanδ=2A/D=1，δ=45°。~For an assumed vertical hole of diameter 0.10 m and sinusoidal half-amplitude 0.05 m, tanδ=2A/D=1 and δ=45°.||以人工選點和自動擬合互相比較，標示正弦最高最低點及實測孔徑；利用定向岩心查核傾向，偏斜孔須做完整三維旋轉，不能只把傾角加上孔斜。~Compare manual picks with automated fitting, marking extrema and measured diameter; verify orientation with oriented core and apply a full three-dimensional transformation in deviated holes instead of simply adding borehole inclination.||把峰谷差誤當半振幅會高估傾角，孔徑擴大未更新也會使姿態偏差；成像曲線雖擬合良好，錯誤幾何仍會導致楔體方向判斷失準。~Using peak-to-trough height as half-amplitude overestimates dip, while uncorrected enlargement also biases orientation. A well-fitted sinusoid can therefore yield a wrong wedge direction through incorrect geometry.
深度與速度校準~Depth and speed calibration||纜線伸長、滑輪打滑與記錄延遲會使影像深度偏離鑽孔記錄。垂直像素間距依賴移動速度及掃描頻率，只有固定時間間隔並不保證固定深度間距，必須使用校正後的深度編碼。~Cable stretch, wheel slip and latency shift image depth relative to the log. Vertical pixel spacing depends on travel speed and scan frequency; fixed time intervals do not guarantee fixed depth spacing without corrected depth encoding.||假設移動速度0.05 m/s、掃描20行/s，垂直間距0.0025 m=2.5 mm；速度加倍則為5 mm。~At assumed travel speed 0.05 m/s and 20 scan lines/s, vertical spacing is 0.0025 m=2.5 mm; doubling speed makes it 5 mm.||利用已知套管端或清楚地層標記校準深度，對照上行下行影像的同一特徵；保留速度變化及編碼器原始值，若誤差隨深度累積，先修正測深系統再討論地層錯動。~Calibrate depth against a known casing end or distinct marker and compare the same feature in upward and downward logs; retain speed and encoder records and resolve cumulative depth error before interpreting geological displacement.||速度突變會拉長或壓縮裂隙影像，深度漂移則使同一裂隙看似兩條；以錯位資料對照水力試驗，可能將導水能力配給錯誤構造面。~Speed changes stretch or compress fracture images, while depth drift can make one fracture appear twice. Misaligned hydraulic comparisons can then assign transmissivity to the wrong structural plane.
磁方位與鋼材影響~Magnetic azimuth and steel effects||磁羅盤在鋼套管附近或含磁性礦物岩層會失真，圖像正北標記因此不一定是地理北。方位偏差不改變正弦形狀，故肉眼難以發現，必須以獨立定向資料檢查。~Steel casing and magnetic minerals disturb a compass, so the image north marker may differ from geographic north. Azimuth bias leaves sinusoidal shape unchanged and is hard to spot visually, requiring independent orientation evidence.||假設投影長20 m、方位偏5°，側向誤差20sin5°=1.74 m；同一裂隙傾角可能仍看似正確。~For assumed projected length 20 m and azimuth bias 5°, lateral error is 20sin5°=1.74 m even while the fracture dip appears correct.||將磁場強度及套管位置隨深度繪圖，對照陀螺定向或已知方向控制段；標明磁偏角轉換年份與坐標基準，超出可接受方位不確定度的區段不得直接用於楔體分析。~Plot magnetic strength and casing position with depth and compare gyro orientation or a known control interval; document declination date and coordinate datum, excluding inadequately oriented intervals from direct wedge analysis.||把磁北當真北會讓所有節理組一致旋轉，統計仍集中卻整體錯誤；若再與隧道軸線比較，可能錯判某組是否會朝開挖空間出露。~Treating magnetic north as true north rotates every joint set coherently, preserving a tight but wrong distribution. Comparison with the tunnel axis can then misidentify whether a set daylights into the opening.
孔徑與工具偏心~Caliper and tool eccentricity||工具偏離孔中心會讓不同方位的聲程不對稱，孔徑擴大又改變影像的幾何比例。橢圓孔壁可能是原位應力破壞，也可能來自鑽進磨損，不能只憑一張孔徑圖指定成因。~Tool eccentricity makes acoustic paths unequal around the hole, while enlargement changes image scale. An elliptical wall may reflect stress-induced damage or drilling wear; one caliper image cannot establish the cause.||假設兩向孔徑110與100 mm，橢圓度(110−100)/100=10%；這是幾何指標而非應力比。~Assumed orthogonal diameters 110 and 100 mm give ovality (110−100)/100=10%; this is a geometric index, not a stress ratio.||比較多臂孔徑、工具居中狀態及兩次影像，檢查異常是否固定在地理方向；若形狀跟工具旋轉而變，優先查量測偏心，只有重複且有岩壁證據的特徵才供應力判釋。~Compare multi-arm caliper, centralization and repeat images, checking whether anomalies remain fixed geographically; if shape follows tool rotation investigate eccentricity first, reserving stress interpretation for repeatable wall-supported features.||偏心造成的亮暗帶可能被當成兩側崩落，過度校正又會抹去真實孔壁破壞；誤判將使應力方向與支護推論都偏離實際。~Eccentricity bands may be mistaken for paired breakouts, while excessive correction can erase genuine damage. Either error seriously misdirects stress orientation and subsequent support interpretations.
表觀裂隙開度~Apparent fracture aperture||影像中的暗帶寬度同時受真實開度、斜交幾何、像素尺寸與覆膜影響。聲學反射缺失也可能因粗糙度造成，所以影像開度是觀測描述，不能未校準就代入裂隙流公式。~A dark band width reflects true aperture, intersection angle, pixel size and coatings. Missing acoustic returns may also result from roughness. Image aperture is therefore an observation, not an uncalibrated input to fracture-flow equations.||假設像素尺度0.2 mm、暗帶3像素，表觀寬0.6 mm；若邊界各有1像素誤差，寬度誤差可達0.4 mm。~At an assumed pixel scale 0.2 mm, a 3-pixel band is 0.6 mm wide; one-pixel error at each boundary can change width by 0.4 mm.||用已知縫寬標準件評估影像點擴散與邊界選取，再比較不同光源或聲學模式；把表觀寬度、校準開度與液壓等效開度分欄保存，無法換算者不得混用。~Evaluate edge selection and image spreading with a known-gap target and compare illumination or acoustic modes; preserve apparent width, calibrated aperture and hydraulic aperture in separate fields and do not interchange unconverted values.||將暗帶寬直接當水力開度會因立方關係放大流量誤差，岩壁染色更可能使封閉裂隙看似很寬；錯誤導水判斷會誤導後續調查位置。~Using band width as hydraulic aperture amplifies flow errors through the cubic relation, and staining can make a closed crack look wide, misdirecting subsequent investigation of conductive zones.
裂隙組與取樣偏差~Joint sets and sampling bias||孔壁看到的是被孔截交的裂隙，不是所有方向等機率的樣本。組群分析應同時考慮取向、深度與可讀性，少量離群點可能是真實構造轉折，不能為了漂亮群集全部刪除。~The image includes only fractures intersected by the hole, not an equal-probability sample of orientations. Clustering must consider direction, depth and readability; a few outliers may mark real structural changes rather than disposable noise.||假設可讀孔段20 m截交30條裂隙，線性密度1.5 m⁻¹；不經方向修正不能當體積裂隙密度。~If an assumed readable 20 m interval intersects 30 fractures, linear intensity is 1.5 m⁻¹; it is not volumetric fracture density without orientation treatment.||以球面圖標示每條裂隙及其深度，和不同方向孔的組群比較；保留人工挑點、擬合殘差及可讀性遮罩，只有可解釋的測量錯誤可排除，地質離群則另列。~Plot each fracture with depth on a stereonet and compare differently oriented holes; retain manual picks, fit residuals and readability masks, excluding only justified measurement errors while retaining geological outliers separately.||若把不利取向的少數裂隙當雜訊，可能漏掉主控楔體；把影像不清的區間放入分母，又會低估裂隙密度並造成假的岩質改善。~Discarding sparse adverse orientations may remove the planes controlling a wedge. Including unreadable intervals in the denominator also underestimates fracture intensity and creates artificial improvement in rock quality.
導水裂隙交叉證據~Cross-evidence for conductive fractures||影像辨識開放構造，流量測井辨識水的實際交換，兩者回答不同問題。多條裂隙可能只有一條連通遠方含水層，水力邊界改變時導水角色也可能改變，不能只依外觀排序。~Images identify visible structures while flow logs identify actual water exchange. Among many fractures only one may connect to a distant aquifer. Hydraulic boundary changes can alter their roles, so appearance alone cannot rank conductivity.||假設某裂隙上下流量由0.20增至0.35 L/s，局部增量0.15 L/s；只有深度與穩態條件一致時可歸因。~An assumed flow increase from 0.20 to 0.35 L/s across a fracture gives 0.15 L/s locally, attributable only with aligned depth and steady conditions.||將孔內流量、溫度與影像裂隙標記對齊，核對抽水或自然狀態及時間；以隔離區間試驗確認連通，報告將可見裂隙與證實導水裂隙分開，避免外觀推論充當試驗結果。~Align flow, temperature and image picks, documenting pumping or ambient state and time; confirm connectivity with interval testing and distinguish visible fractures from hydraulically demonstrated ones in the report.||缺少深度校準會把流量躍變配到鄰近裂隙，非穩態儲存也能製造假交換；結果可能在錯誤位置安排封堵，留下真正的導水通道。~Depth mismatch assigns a flow change to the wrong fracture, and transient storage can mimic exchange. Treatment may then target the wrong location while the true conductive path remains unresolved.
自動判讀與盲查~Automated interpretation and blind checks||演算法擅長找連續曲線，但電纜陰影、層理和鑽痕也可形成規律圖樣。訓練資料的岩性與水況限制模型外推，須以獨立人工盲查估計漏判和誤判，而非只看輸出數量。~Algorithms find continuous curves, but cable shadows, bedding and drill marks can also form regular patterns. Training lithology and water conditions limit transfer, requiring independent blind checks of misses and false detections rather than output counts alone.||假設人工確認20條裂隙，模型找到16條且另誤報4條，召回率16/20=80%，精確率16/(16+4)=80%。~For an assumed 20 confirmed fractures, 16 detections plus 4 false positives give recall 80% and precision 16/(16+4)=80%.||預先選定含不同可讀性與岩性的盲查區段，將人工與模型逐條配對並保存漏判原因；部署版本與訓練域需可追溯，不以同一批調參影像宣稱獨立驗證。~Preselect blind intervals covering lithology and readability, match manual and model detections and retain reasons for misses; preserve deployed version and training domain, never calling tuning images independent validation.||只在清楚影像測試會高估模型效能，模糊水況下可能系統性漏掉細裂隙；以演算法輸出當真值再訓練，會把原先偏差固化。~Testing only clear images overstates performance and may hide systematic loss of fine fractures in turbid water. Retraining on automated output treated as truth perpetuates the initial bias.
影像資料工程交接~Image-data engineering handover||成像報告的線條是判釋結果，原始影像與校正紀錄才讓後人重建判斷。深度、方位、孔徑與採集條件必須形成版本一致的資料組，否則漂亮三維模型不能支援可追溯的工程審查。~Interpretation lines are results, while raw images and calibration allow reconstruction. Depth, azimuth, diameter and acquisition conditions must form a version-consistent dataset; an attractive three-dimensional model alone cannot support an auditable engineering review.||假設100條判釋裂隙中92條具完整原圖與校準鏈，追溯率92%；其餘8條需個別標示證據缺口。~If 92 of an assumed 100 interpreted fractures have complete image and calibration chains, traceability is 92%; the other 8 need explicit individual evidence gaps.||隨機抽取裂隙由三維模型回查原圖、選點、校正及孔號，確認座標和深度版本一致；資料管理者與地質師共同簽認無法追溯項，設計者才能知道哪些判釋可重算。~Trace sampled model fractures to raw images, picks, corrections and hole identity, checking coordinate and depth versions; data and geology leads jointly identify untraceable records so designers know which interpretations can be reconstructed.||只有匯出圖片而無原始資料時，後續無法修正方位或重新判讀；若舊版裂隙混入新孔跡，整合模型可能出現不存在的交線與楔體。~Image exports without raw records cannot support orientation correction or reinterpretation. Combining old fracture picks with a new trajectory may create intersections and wedges that never existed.
''')
 compact('b130','區分原位應力、測試擾動與反演假設，建立可審查的應力模型~Separate in-situ stress, test disturbance and inversion assumptions in an auditable stress model',['isrm-stress','isrm-methods'],r'''
覆土重量基準~Overburden stress baseline||垂直自重應力由上覆岩層重量積分而來，但山谷地形與構造應力會使局部狀態偏離一維近似。覆土估值提供量級檢查，不能取代現地量測，更不能據此假設水平應力必然相同。~Vertical overburden follows the integrated weight of rock, but topography and tectonic stress alter local conditions. The estimate is a scale check rather than a replacement for measurement, and does not imply equal horizontal stress.||假設平均密度2600 kg/m³、深度500 m，σv=ρgh=12.75 MPa；未計地形與構造修正。~With assumed mean density 2600 kg/m³ and depth 500 m, σv=ρgh=12.75 MPa, excluding topographic and tectonic corrections.||用地形、分層密度及孔口高程建立自重包絡，與量測分量在同一坐標比較；顯著差異須先查基準與局部地形，再由岩工工程師評估是否反映構造或測試擾動。~Build an overburden envelope from topography, layered density and collar elevation and compare measured components in one frame; investigate datum and topography before interpreting differences as tectonics or testing disturbance.||把隧道深度誤用為海拔會造成大幅應力錯估，忽略谷側自由面也可能高估約束；之後用錯誤基準判定量測失敗，反而刪除真實高水平應力。~Using altitude instead of cover depth grossly misestimates stress, while ignoring a valley free surface overstates confinement. The incorrect baseline may then cause genuine high horizontal stress to be rejected.
應力張量與主值~Stress tensor and principal values||應力是具有方向的張量，單一法向讀值不能描述岩體三維受力。主應力由張量特徵值求得，旋轉坐標只改變分量表達，不改變主值；壓縮正負號與剪應力定義需一致。~Stress is a directional tensor, not one normal reading. Principal stresses are its eigenvalues; rotating coordinates changes components but not the principal values. Compression sign convention and shear definitions must remain consistent throughout the analysis.||假設平面σx=12、σy=8、τxy=3 MPa，主值10±√13，得13.61及6.39 MPa；未代表第三主值。~For assumed plane components σx=12, σy=8 and τxy=3 MPa, principal values are 10±√13=13.61 and 6.39 MPa; no third principal stress is specified.||獨立計算特徵值並檢查跡與行列式在旋轉前後不變，對照儀器座標到地理座標的旋轉矩陣；報告列出量測分量、符號和未辨識方向，避免用二維結果假裝完整三維狀態。~Independently calculate eigenvalues and verify invariant trace and determinant, checking the instrument-to-geographic rotation matrix; report measured components, signs and unresolved directions rather than presenting a plane result as complete three-dimensional stress.||交換剪應力符號會旋轉主方向，單位或坐標軸混淆又可能保持合理主值卻方向錯誤；支護與岩爆評估因此可能針對錯誤方位。~Reversing shear sign rotates principal direction; unit or axis mistakes can leave plausible magnitudes with incorrect orientation. Support and rockburst assessments may consequently focus on the wrong direction.
有效應力與孔壓~Effective stress and pore pressure||岩骨架承擔的有效應力取決於總應力與孔壓耦合，Biot係數不一定恰為一。減壓或開挖同時改變邊界與排水條件，不能用同一孔壓直接扣所有已受擾動測點。~Effective skeleton stress depends on total stress, pore pressure and a Biot coefficient that need not equal one. Depressurization and excavation change boundaries and drainage, so one pressure value cannot be subtracted indiscriminately at disturbed locations.||假設σ=15 MPa、u=3 MPa、α=0.8，σ′=σ−αu=12.6 MPa；若係數α=1則為12 MPa。~For assumed σ=15 MPa, u=3 MPa and α=0.8, σ′=σ−αu=12.6 MPa; with α=1 it becomes 12 MPa.||將孔壓量測與應力試驗時間、隔離區間及排水狀態對齊，明列係數來源；比較總應力與有效應力兩種輸出，只有同一物理定義與飽和狀態的結果才可合併。~Align pore-pressure observations with test time, isolated interval and drainage state and document coefficient origin; report total and effective values separately, combining only results with consistent physical definition and saturation.||重複扣除已換算過的孔壓會低估有效應力，忽略未平衡壓力又會使不同方法看似矛盾；錯誤可能被誤解為真實的空間應力變化。~Subtracting pore pressure twice underestimates effective stress, while nonequilibrated pressure makes methods appear inconsistent. Such bookkeeping errors can be mistaken for genuine spatial stress variation.
套鑽應變回復~Overcoring strain relief||套鑽釋放局部約束後的應變，需配合彈性常數反演原始應力。岩石若有裂隙、塑性或溫度變化，回復量不再只來自彈性卸載，感測器黏結和方向也會控制可辨識性。~Overcoring measures strain released by local unloading and requires elastic constants for stress inversion. Fractures, plasticity and temperature add nonelastic changes, while gauge bonding and orientation control what components can be identified.||假設單軸示意E=40 GPa、回復應變200 με，σ=Eε=8 MPa；實際多軸套鑽需完整校正矩陣。~For an assumed uniaxial illustration E=40 GPa and relieved strain 200 με, σ=Eε=8 MPa; real multiaxial overcoring requires a full calibration matrix.||檢查各量規卸載歷程及溫度補償，試後保存岩心確認破裂與黏結狀態；以同方向試件測彈性常數，反演殘差及異常通道需逐項說明，不以平均值掩蓋失效量規。~Inspect each gauge relief history and temperature correction, preserving recovered core for fracture and bond checks; measure directional elastic properties and explain inversion residuals and faulty channels individually rather than averaging them away.||套鑽過程新裂縫會產生突然應變跳動，若照線彈性式解讀便可能得到虛假的高應力；量規脫黏也可能呈現平順但偏低的回復。~A new crack during overcoring produces a strain jump that linear inversion can misread as high stress; debonded gauges may instead show smooth but falsely low relief.
水力破裂壓力判讀~Hydraulic-fracture pressure interpretation||壓力歷程包含管路儲能、裂縫起裂、延伸與閉合，不同轉折對應不同物理事件。閉合壓力可提供特定法向應力線索，但既有節理重開與滲漏會讓簡化理論不適用。~Pressure history combines line storage, initiation, propagation and closure, with different transitions representing different processes. Closure informs a specific normal stress, but reopening existing joints and leakage can invalidate simple interpretations.||假設地表讀值8 MPa、測段低100 m且水密度1000 kg/m³，靜水修正0.981 MPa，井下8.981 MPa；未計流動損失。~Assume surface pressure 8 MPa and an interval 100 m lower with water density 1000 kg/m³; static correction 0.981 MPa gives 8.981 MPa downhole, excluding flowing losses.||由合格試驗團隊記錄完整壓力流量時間曲線與隔離狀態，交叉使用不同閉合判讀方法並保存分歧；井下壓力須校正高程與管路效應，判讀由岩工工程師核准，教學值不是加壓指令。~A qualified team records complete pressure-flow-time history and isolation state; compare closure interpretations and retain disagreement, correcting elevation and line effects before rock-engineering approval. Teaching values are not pressurization instructions.||把泵停止時的瞬間尖峰當閉合壓力會混入管路效應，隔離失效又可能使壓力下降看似裂縫延伸；兩者均可導致應力量值失真。~Treating the immediate pump-stop spike as closure pressure includes line effects, while failed isolation may make leakage resemble fracture extension. Both distort the inferred stress magnitude.
孔壁崩落與方位~Borehole breakouts and orientation||孔壁應力集中可造成成對崩落，但鑽具磨損、節理剝落也可能留下近似形狀。方向推論需符合孔軸、岩性與應力集中模型，裂縫影像和孔徑資料應相互支持而不是互相替代。~Stress concentration can form paired breakouts, but drilling wear and joint spalling produce similar shapes. Orientation inference must fit the hole axis, lithology and concentration model, with images and calipers providing complementary evidence.||假設線彈性均質等向岩、無內壓自由圓孔壁，孔軸沿第三主應力方向；遠場主水平應力20與10 MPa，最大環向壓應力3×20−10=50 MPa。~Assume homogeneous isotropic linear elasticity, a traction-free circular wall without internal pressure, and borehole axis along the third principal direction; horizontal principal stresses 20 and 10 MPa give maximum hoop compression 50 MPa.||比對成對特徵是否沿深度穩定、與已知鑽具方向無關，並查核孔壁裂縫與岩性轉換；方向估計附可用區間及不確定度，僅在模型假設成立時才供主應力方位推論。~Check whether paired features persist with depth independently of drilling orientation and compare wall cracks and lithology; report usable intervals and angular uncertainty, inferring stress direction only when the mechanical assumptions are justified.||把單側節理剝落當成應力崩落會給錯誤主方向，孔徑平均又會抹去成對特徵；若未檢查局部破裂，方向結果可能只是鑽進痕跡。~Interpreting one-sided joint spalling as a breakout gives a false principal direction, while averaged caliper data erase paired features. Unchecked orientation results may describe drilling marks rather than stress.
彈性各向異性~Elastic anisotropy||層理岩沿不同方向有不同剛度，量到相同應變未必代表相同應力。以等向性反演各向異性岩石會把材料方向性錯配成應力方向性，因此取樣方向與彈性矩陣須同步交接。~Layered rock has direction-dependent stiffness, so equal strain need not mean equal stress. Isotropic inversion can misattribute material anisotropy to stress anisotropy, requiring specimen orientation and elastic matrices to accompany the measurements.||假設同一100 με在兩向模數20與40 GPa下，單軸示意應力分別2與4 MPa；並非完整各向異性解。~For assumed strain 100 με and directional moduli 20 and 40 GPa, uniaxial illustrative stresses are 2 and 4 MPa, not a full anisotropic solution.||以定向試件量測多方向剛度及泊松效應，核對儀器方向與層理方向；比較等向與各向異性反演殘差，若資料不足以辨識全部常數，需給出模型範圍而非硬湊唯一解。~Test oriented specimens for directional stiffness and lateral response and align gauge and bedding directions; compare isotropic and anisotropic inversion residuals, reporting model bounds when data cannot identify every elastic constant.||模數選錯方向會使應力比例偏差，增加量規數卻不增加方向資訊仍不能解決；過度參數化反演可能完美擬合雜訊而失去物理可信度。~Using stiffness from the wrong direction biases stress ratios, and adding gauges without directional diversity does not cure it. An overparameterized inversion can fit noise perfectly while losing physical credibility.
開挖擾動與距離~Excavation disturbance and distance||隧道附近量到的應力已受自由面卸載與集中影響，距掌子面遠不一定等於未擾動。應以開挖幾何、破裂帶與量測時序判斷代表性，不能直接把近壁測點當成遠場應力。~Stress near a tunnel is redistributed by unloading and concentration; distance from the face alone does not prove undisturbed conditions. Excavation geometry, damage and timing determine whether a measurement represents the far field.||假設圓孔彈性影響項比例a²/r²，a=5 m、r=15 m時為1/9=0.111；只是幾何衰減項，不是完整應力。~For an assumed circular-opening elastic term a²/r² with a=5 m and r=15 m, the term is 1/9=0.111; it is not the complete stress solution.||把測點放入已記錄施工階段的三維模型，與不同距離、不同時間測點比較；若近壁裂隙或塑性明顯，需使用相應模型說明擾動，不能用單一距離門檻宣布原位代表性。~Place measurements in a model matching recorded excavation stages and compare locations and times; where near-wall cracking or plasticity is evident, model disturbance explicitly rather than declaring representativeness from one distance threshold.||將卸載後低應力當成原始狀態會低估深部風險，將局部集中當遠場又會過度放大；兩者皆使後續開挖分析的邊界載入不正確。~Using unloaded stress as the initial state underestimates deeper risk, while treating local concentration as far-field stress exaggerates it. Both apply incorrect boundary loading in subsequent excavation analysis.
反演殘差與不確定~Inversion residuals and uncertainty||多通道反演可利用冗餘資料檢查模型，但小殘差只表示資料彼此相容，不代表假設一定正確。系統性溫度偏差會同時污染多個通道，須以獨立方法與重複測點辨識。~Redundant channels test internal model consistency, but small residuals do not prove correct assumptions. A systematic thermal bias can contaminate all channels together and requires independent methods and repeated locations to identify.||假設三個應變殘差3、−4、0 με，RMSE=√(25/3)=2.89 με；此值不含共同零點偏移。~For assumed strain residuals 3,−4 and 0 με, RMSE=√(25/3)=2.89 με; this excludes a shared zero offset.||檢查殘差方向與溫度、深度及量規通道的相關性，以留一通道方式檢查反演穩健性；報告保留原始訊號、校準與參數協方差，對共同偏差另做敏感度分析。~Examine residual correlations with temperature, depth and channel and test leave-one-channel stability; retain raw signals, calibrations and parameter covariance, with separate sensitivity analysis for common-mode biases.||只選殘差最小的模型可能選中過度擬合，測點共享校準偏差又讓重複結果看似可靠；其後把窄信賴區間當成真實地質均一性會誤導設計。~Choosing the smallest residual can favor overfitting, and shared calibration bias makes repeated measurements appear reliable. A narrow fitted interval may then be wrongly treated as evidence of uniform geological stress.
應力模型工程移交~Engineering stress-model handover||場址應力模型需整合多種方法、地形與構造，保留互相矛盾的資料及解釋。模型應提供應力張量隨位置的範圍，而非只有三個代表值；施工揭露新資訊時才能合理更新邊界條件。~A site stress model integrates methods, topography and structure while retaining contradictory data and interpretations. Spatial tensor ranges, rather than only three representative numbers, allow excavation evidence to update boundary conditions rationally.||假設三測點最大主應力18、22、26 MPa，平均22 MPa、範圍8 MPa；小樣本不能據此宣稱全場正態分布。~Assumed maximum principal stresses 18,22 and 26 MPa have mean 22 MPa and range 8 MPa; this small sample does not establish a site-wide normal distribution.||交付各測點坐標、方法、時間、排水狀態與張量不確定度，選取低中高情境重算主控機制；由岩工、設計與施工負責人確認哪些新觀測會觸發模型重審。~Deliver coordinates, methods, time, drainage and tensor uncertainty for each location and analyze low, central and high scenarios; rock, design and construction leads agree which new observations trigger model review.||把不同深度和不同方法直接平均會抹去構造分區，缺少符號或坐標定義更會使接收者誤用；即使平均數正確，整個開挖模型仍可能承受錯向載入。~Averaging different depths and methods erases structural domains; missing signs or coordinate definitions invite misuse. Even a correct average can apply loads in the wrong direction to the excavation model.
''')
